This directory is meant to include complete fully functional examples
for several mpsim setups.  

Please, try to minimize the external dependencies of these examples.  
They are meant to work out of the box by just checking out the individual 
example directory.

os-less:
	These examples do not assume any special dependency. Just
	the mpsim simulator and any suitable toolchain. Please, edit
	the Makefile on each example to configure your particular 
	toolchain (CROSS variable).

rtems:
	These examples assume you have an mpsim enabled version of
	RTEMS. Today (2006-06-12) the only supported version is
	RTEMS 4.6.0pre3 with the MPARM patches. Please, edit the
	Makefile accordingly to set up the RTEMS_MAKEFILE_PATH variable.

uclinux:
	These examples assume you have an mpsim enabled version of
	uClinux (e.g. vendor SWARM, product SWARM).

